      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Spigelian hernia (SH) is a rare entity accounting for 1-2% of ventral abdominal wall hernias. Elusive clinical signs and symptoms pose a diagnostic challenge and a consequent risk of strangulation. We present an emergent case of a Spigelian hernia involving the appendix."},
